{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42271","headline":"送龚员外赴江州幕 · 徐铉","name":"送龚员外赴江州幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烦君更上筑金台，世难民劳藉俊才。\n自有声名驰羽檄，不妨谈笑奉尊罍。\n元规楼迥清风满，匡俗山春画障开。\n莫忘故人离别恨，海潮回处寄书来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}